-- Ongoing policy reconciliation.
-- Authored in the recommended .pql script form (single statement, semicolon-
-- terminated). The legacy .statements.json form remains supported for
-- backward compatibility but is not the recommended way to author new
-- migrations.

-- Re-apply the lifecycle policy to every matching index. The wildcard adapts
-- to current cluster state; ISM's change_policy is idempotent so re-running
-- on every startup (this migration is journal: false) is cheap.
APPLY POLICY sample_app_events_lifecycle TO sample_app_events-*;
